      "side": 1,
      "message": "During start the order is:\n```\n1. informe profileProxy\n2. put in map\n3. informe listener\n```\nI would expect the teardown to do the reverse order but here we are doing:\n```\n2. remove from map\n3. inform listener            // should this be done before ?\n1. inform proxy\n```\n\nCan we face race condition ?",
