      "writtenOn": "2023-12-08T01:36:17Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "The order in the teardown is the \"right\" one, initially I put the getProfileProxy order as\n\n```\n1. inform profileProxy\n2. inform listener\n3. put in map\n```\n\nI reversed it for multiple reasons:\n- It allow to handle a onBluetoothOff between `2 and 3`\n- It also ensures that it was put in the map before calling the user, ensuring the profile proxy can be closed ASAP.\n\nBut thinking about it, I think there is a possible race condition, i\u0027ll try to fix it.",
      "parentUuid": "b8a14dcb_2879310c",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 3771,
        "startChar": 8,
        "endLine": 3779,
        "endChar": 42
      },
      "revId": "1436cdc06985615e5bb21aa705a078b3589d6a78",
